WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.220
Hello everybody, my name is Markiplier and welcome to Eleanor's Stairway!

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:10.860
Now this is just a demo and I believe it's a short demo to a game that is not released yet or may have been canceled.

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:13.740
I'm not a 100% sure on the status of the whole game

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:17.320
but I have to say that this looks... phenomenal.

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:18.860
Like it really does look good.

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:27.500
And I think it was inspired by, or at least some form of adaptation from Silent Hill P.T.

00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:31.540
Or the 'playable teaser' cause it's called Eleanor's Stairway playable teaser.

00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:35.780
But it looks like someone had a party here and I wasn't invited. &gt;:(

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:39.560
Why?! I'm a cool guy that likes to party and stuff.

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:43.180
I'm not an introvert that sits at home alone, *giggle* playing video games all day.

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:46.440
Wow! This looks ... Hey...Oh, hi. How's it going?

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:47.500
Well...

00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:52.560
this house is too fancy for my taste and holy crap it is just going nuts out there.

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:56.560
Now what's even more amazing is that this game is made in Unity and I usually don't see...

00:00:56.580 --> 00:00:59.560
good graphics like this in Unity running very well all that often.

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:03.140
Holy crap. What is that? Just a drop into the abyss?!

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:07.120
What is this? S... SCP-087-B?

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:10.280
*sound of metal soda can falling and laughing*
Whoa, hey, thank you. Hi!

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:11.860
Oh!

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:14.780
Is that supposed to look like a figure of a man?

00:01:14.780 --> 00:01:16.780
Ah! It just looks so cool.

00:01:16.940 --> 00:01:22.020
OK. Hello? Ah, yeah. OK. Alright.

00:01:22.280 --> 00:01:25.020
Loooong narrow hallway with NOTHING BEHIND ME!

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:28.080
NOTHING!

00:01:29.660 --> 00:01:31.300
*main character footsteps*

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:32.620
NOTHING!

00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:35.240
Okay, we're fine.

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:41.220
Hello! Ka-chunk. Ahhh! It so is!!! That's awe-

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:43.000
*woman crying*

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:43.500
Hi.

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:45.540
*woman crying intensifies*

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:46.160
Hey?

00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:53.160
*woman continues crying at life*

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:53.800
Okay...

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:57.580
*woman still crying*

00:01:57.580 --> 00:01:59.740
Okay, I think she's just gonna keep crying like that...

00:01:59.740 --> 00:02:00.920
*multiple knocks*

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:03.380
Hi! Oh! That's a lot of noises happenin'.

00:02:03.380 --> 00:02:06.240
*woman crying and knocking intensifies*

00:02:06.240 --> 00:02:07.840
Oh geez! Man...

00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:10.980
Ooookay... *ominous music* No, grandma!

00:02:11.720 --> 00:02:12.320
Oh boy!

00:02:12.320 --> 00:02:15.720
*sounds of crying, static, and siren-like noises*

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:16.440
Oh!

00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:17.500
*sounds of crying, static, and siren-like noises continue*

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:19.360
Well, that is exceptionally disconcerting

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:20.920
*sounds of crying, static, and siren-like noises still going*

00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:23.240
I'm starting to get spooped up in here!

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:27.560
It's geting real spoopy. Oh geez! Ugh geez!

00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:31.140
Alright, let me escape the wails of the damned for a second.

00:02:31.940 --> 00:02:36.740
To find the source of all the- Oooooooh! Heeeeeey! Oh-ho my god!

00:02:36.980 --> 00:02:40.060
Hi! Were you the one crying?

00:02:40.060 --> 00:02:43.460
Am I supposed the be expected to walk toward you twitchy face?

00:02:44.120 --> 00:02:45.200
Oh goddamn...

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:48.820
"FloatyFeet McTwitchyface" over here.
Don't come charging at me.

00:02:48.820 --> 00:02:51.880
If you do, I will be so pissed. Anything behind me?

00:02:52.489 --> 00:02:57.260
No! Alright give 'big daddy Markiplier' ;) a big old hug.

00:02:57.320 --> 00:03:00.140
Come on! Ugh... OH HEY!

00:03:00.140 --> 00:03:01.400
*crying slows down*

00:03:01.400 --> 00:03:03.080
Goodbye? Hello?

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:05.440
*crying continues then abruptly stops*

00:03:05.440 --> 00:03:07.060
Okay... Oh good!

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:11.900
Alright, let's go for one more loop, why
not? Oh, I've been having fun.

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:15.100
Why not continue on with the party? Holy shit...

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:16.040
Okay.

00:03:16.980 --> 00:03:17.480
Well then.

00:03:17.700 --> 00:03:22.740
*quiet footsteps of the main character*

00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:25.800
Okay... Is the statue still there? Yeah still there.

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:28.100
Looking creepier than ever.

00:03:28.120 --> 00:03:29.220
Still there.

00:03:29.220 --> 00:03:29.720
Hi grandma.

00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:32.580
Sorry about the illumination going away from your face.

00:03:32.820 --> 00:03:35.260
You were just too ugly for this world
apparently.

00:03:35.260 --> 00:03:36.700
*door creaking open; sharp inhale*

00:03:36.700 --> 00:03:38.300
Hiii..- Oh hi!

00:03:38.540 --> 00:03:39.040
*crying*

00:03:39.040 --> 00:03:39.519
*screams* AH WHAT THE FUCK?! AM I SUPPOSED TO GO DOWN?!

00:03:39.519 --> 00:03:42.100
What the fuck? Am I supposed to go down? Oh. Ok.

00:03:42.100 --> 00:03:42.780
OH.

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:45.660
*crying*

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:46.280
Okay!?

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:51.860
What do I do? Oh geez, oh geez, oh geez. Ahhh! She's coming for me.

00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:55.480
Oh shit, she's coming for me for. Oh shit, she's coming me! Heeeey lady...

00:03:55.480 --> 00:03:59.000
Oh, geez. *laughs* Your lack of animation is awfully disturbing.

00:03:59.160 --> 00:04:01.480
*high pitched screaming* Open the door! *high pitched scream*

00:04:01.680 --> 00:04:02.180
Heh.

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:06.420
*static* Ugh- oh hi! Oh. Hey! Oh. Uh oh. That ain't good.

00:04:06.540 --> 00:04:07.540
That ain't good at all.

00:04:07.940 --> 00:04:09.060
*confused groaning*

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:11.680
*static

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:13.020
*static stops as game ends*

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:13.600
Okay..

00:04:13.740 --> 00:04:15.660
AWWW NOOOOOOO...

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:19.800
NOOO... THAT WAS IT!? Oh, that was so short!

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:24.120
Oh no! That was well made!

00:04:24.600 --> 00:04:28.540
Oh, that was really well made! Awwww, man!

00:04:28.720 --> 00:04:31.920
Oh, it was so- aww, man. It's always like-

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:34.720
these really cool indie horror games.

00:04:34.820 --> 00:04:38.420
Y'know, they take so much work and it's usually just like one guy doing it. So,

00:04:38.780 --> 00:04:41.880
having it all crammed into one game
often means that there's not as much as

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:45.020
you would want out of a cool experience
like this. But this is really good!

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:49.920
I really don't know what the status of
this project is... but this is well done. And-

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:54.220
That's- that's really nice. Okay. But either way
this is really well done you can check

00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:57.760
this out for yourself. I'll put a link to
the... the game development page.

00:04:57.760 --> 00:05:01.240
I hope it's still going on whoever the
developer is, this looks great.

00:05:01.450 --> 00:05:04.960
You got a lot of talent. This is good stuff
here. So, thank you everybody so much for

00:05:04.960 --> 00:05:08.860
watching! And as always, I will see YOU... in
the next video!

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:11.540
BUH-BYE!

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:13.540
*outro music: "Haunted" by Shirk*

